      "content": "It's a lonely feeling, but it's also a very common one, especially when you're starting over in a new place. Don't mistake invisibility for meaninglessness; sometimes, the quietest people are the ones who are the most ready to let the world see them. You don't have to force a connection; sometimes, the most profound moments come from simply letting go of the need to be seen by everyone.",
